sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Frontend
    participant API as API Route (tests.py)
    participant LLM as TestGenerationService
    participant Verifier as TestExecutionVerifier
    participant WS as WorkspaceManager
    participant Stability as TestStabilityValidator
    participant Cov as TestCoverageService
    participant Sandbox as Isolated Subprocess / Runner

    User->>API: POST /repositories/{id}/generate-tests
    API->>LLM: generate_tests(...)
    LLM-->>API: TestGenerationResult (synthesized test)
    API->>Verifier: verify_generated_test(...)
    
    Verifier->>WS: create_workspace(directory_copy)
    WS-->>Verifier: WorkspaceMetadata (/tmp/.workspaces/task-...)
    
    Note over Verifier,Cov: Collect Baseline Coverage
    Verifier->>Cov: measure_coverage(workspace, target, test=None)
    Cov->>Sandbox: coverage run -m pytest / npm test --coverage
    Sandbox-->>Cov: baseline report (line=40%)
    Cov-->>Verifier: TargetCoverageData(line=40%)
    
    Note over Verifier,Stability: Write generated test & run 3 stability runs
    loop Exactly 3 Consecutive Runs
        Verifier->>Stability: validate_with_sandbox_test_runner(run_idx)
        Stability->>Sandbox: run_tests(pytest -v / npm test --run)
        Sandbox-->>Stability: exit_code=0, passed=1, duration=0.05s
    end
    Stability-->>Verifier: StabilityReport(3/3 PASS -> STABLE)
    
    Note over Verifier,Cov: Collect Post-Gen Coverage
    Verifier->>Cov: measure_coverage(workspace, target, test=proposed_path)
    Cov->>Sandbox: coverage run -m pytest tests/test_generated.py
    Sandbox-->>Cov: post-gen report (line=75%)
    Cov-->>Verifier: TargetCoverageData(line=75%)
    Verifier->>Cov: calculate_coverage_gain(baseline, post-gen)
    Cov-->>Verifier: CoverageReport(gain=+35%, attributable=True)
    
    Verifier->>WS: cleanup_workspace(task_id, force=True)
    WS-->>Verifier: Cleanup OK
    
    Verifier-->>API: TestGenerationResult(status=VERIFIED)
    API-->>User: TestGenerationResponse
